---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../site';
---
<Base title="Privacy" description="How this portfolio handles your information.">
  <div class="wrap case-head"><p class="eyebrow">Last updated October 2026</p><h1>Privacy</h1></div>
  <article class="wrap prose">
    <p>This site uses no cookies, analytics or trackers. Fonts are served from this site, not from Google.</p>
    <h2>Messages you send</h2>
    <p>The contact form sends your name, email, enquiry type and message to my inbox through <a href="https://formsubmit.co/" rel="noopener">FormSubmit</a>. FormSubmit may process these details outside Kenya. I use them only to reply to you, and I delete them after 12 months unless we are still working together.</p>
    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <p>GitHub Pages hosts this site. GitHub may log IP addresses for security, as set out in <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" rel="noopener">its privacy statement</a>.</p>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>Under Kenya's Data Protection Act, 2019, you can ask to see, correct or delete the information I hold about you. Message me on <a href={site.whatsapp} rel="noopener">WhatsApp</a> or use the contact form.</p>
    <p>Data controller: {site.name}, Kiambu, Kenya.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
